Derivation and modifications
----------------------------

The user-interface layer of StartRide is derived from the user-interface layer of an
open-source Minecraft launcher that is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later. StartRide as a
whole is therefore released under the same license. All files derived from that project
have been modified for this project. The user-interface features inherited from it have
been removed from StartRide's navigation; however, part of the inherited code, some of
its internal identifiers, and several third-party dependencies remain in the source tree
and in the released packages, even though they have no user-interface entry point any
more. A list of what is inherited and what is original work is in `README.md`, section
"许可证与来源声明".

This notice is given in accordance with GPL-3.0 section 5(a).

