Third-party binaries bundled with this repository
-------------------------------------------------

The directory `third_party/launcher-libs/` contains 29 unmodified
third-party DLLs that StartRide links against. They are committed to
this repository so that anyone can clone it and build StartRide without
downloading additional binary files, and so that hosted CI can
reproduce the official builds byte for byte.

These binaries are redistributed as-is, each under its own license, and
are NOT covered by this project's GPL-3.0 license. Their copyright
holders are credited, together with version and license information, in
`docs/legal/06-third-party-notices.md` (also shown inside the
application at Settings > Legal > Referenced projects).

No third-party binary is modified, repackaged, or re-signed by this
project.

